@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  roundCorner 0
}
hide <<process>> stereotype
skinparam rectangle<<process>> {
  roundCorner 50
}
title Civic Issue Tracker - Data Flow Diagram: Level 0 (Context)

rectangle Citizen as E1
rectangle Administrator as E2
rectangle "Department\nStaff" as E3
rectangle "0. Civic Issue\nTracker System" as SYS <<process>>

E1 --> SYS : credentials, issue report\n(details + photo + pin),\nupvotes, comments
SYS --> E1 : issue ID + confirmation,\nstatus updates, notifications,\nissue and map views
E2 --> SYS : status changes, assignments,\ncatalog changes, announcements
SYS --> E2 : dashboard statistics,\nall issue reports, notifications
E3 --> SYS : progress updates,\nresolution details
SYS --> E3 : assigned issues, notifications
@enduml
